      "title": "ACME で証明書を取ると HA が同期しなくなる",
      "summary": "ACME で証明書を取ったあと、HA の設定が同期しなくなる。",
      "severity": "medium",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "path": "system ha",
            "key": "mode",
            "op": "in",
            "value": [
              "a-p",
              "a-a"
            ]
          },
          {
            "any": [
              {
                "path": "system acme",
                "key": "interface",
                "op": "exists"
              },
              {
                "path": "vpn certificate local[*]",
                "key": "enroll-protocol",
                "op": "eq",
                "value": "acme2"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "judge": "auto",
      "impact": "HA のメンバーの設定がずれ、フェイルオーバーで動きが変わる。",
      "action": "上げたあと HA の同期の状態（diagnose sys ha checksum）を確かめる。",
      "url": "https://docs.fortinet.com/document/fortigate/7.4.8/fortios-release-notes/236526/known-issues"
    },
